      "x": 460,
      "y": 176,
      "width": 339.56781005859375,
      "height": 108.0,
      "text": "dream: 3 parallel dreams \u2192 2-of-3 consensus \u2192 commit\nreflect: day page \u2192 bank upkeep \u2192 prune \u2192 indexes\n\nthree minds, one dream \u2014 sonnet \u00b7 opus \u00b7 fable\ndream at queue \u2265 10 (checked by take) \u00b7 reflect 23:30",
