      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 2198.3386562790915,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 245.70000000000002,
      "text": "~/.sandman/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 archive/\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 claude/<yyyy>-<mm>-<dd>-<ts>-<orig relpath>   bytes at rest \u2014 take's target\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 log/\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 <date>.md          reflect's day pages\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 INDEX.md           chronological index\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 memories/\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 .recent/<sid>.json    pointers \u2014 short-term (3 days)\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 <bank>/\n        \u251c\u2500\u2500 <type>_<slug>.md   one memory per file\n        \u251c\u2500\u2500 MEMORY.md          the index \u2014 regenerated\n        \u251c\u2500\u2500 _archive/          superseded \u2014 never rm'd\n        \u2514\u2500\u2500 _reflect.json      {at, count, last_ops}",
      "fontSize": 14,
